---
// Reserves the homepage's right-hand grid region for future case-study
// photography. Structural only — no content yet, so it renders as an
// empty, unlabelled div rather than a landmark. Runs the full block-height
// of .at-main so future images can anchor at any row alongside teaching
// content, or slightly overlap the rail/content boundary.
---

<div class="case-study-rail" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .case-study-rail {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (width >= 1200px) {
    .case-study-rail {
      display: block;
      grid-column: rail-start / rail-end;
      grid-row: 1 / span 999;
    }
  }
</style>
